## SQ-DRK-04 | spout fills a bottle from Kiwi Tea (diagnostic: recipe presence)
@group A
@commands Spout and Item Drain: fill a glass bottle from 250 mB of `creativeengineering:kiwi_tea`, `lychee_juice`, `chorus_tea`, `sea_grape_juice` (creative fluid tank); drain a Kiwi Tea back
@pass each fills one bottle of the matching item and drains back to 250 mB
@fails createBottle pair missing for that fluid
@jars creativedelight
@sources feature_writeup/creative_delight_drinks.md
@tier T2
@reviewed 2026-11-20
@from batches/r1103/p2_R2.qb
# r1103 p2: every spout line read "needs -1 mB, gives nothing" (no filling recipe matched) while the drain worked;
# NCH createBottle makes the filling and emptying pair together. List both recipes and retry the spout.
> cdevtest recipes kiwi_tea
> cdevtest recipes lychee_juice
# r1120fix (2026-11-20): bytype create:filling stops at 500 shown lines (kiwi_tea not among them); the recipes lines
# name the filling and emptying pair directly. The s5 spout probe reads "needs -1 mB" even for the water control
# (r1120nv judge-2): its lines are diagnostic only until the probe is fixed.
> cdevtest rdetail creativedelight:createfilling/kiwi_tea
> s5 spout creativedelight:kiwi_tea 250 minecraft:glass_bottle
> s5 spout minecraft:water 250 minecraft:glass_bottle
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:createfilling/kiwi_tea result=creativedelight:kiwi_tea\*1
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:createemptying/kiwi_tea result=minecraft:glass_bottle\*1
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:createfilling/lychee_juice result=creativedelight:lychee_juice\*1
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=recipes id=creativedelight:createemptying/lychee_juice result=minecraft:glass_bottle\*1
look the rdetail of createfilling/kiwi_tea takes a glass bottle and 250 mB creativedelight:kiwi_tea; the two s5 spout lines are diagnostic (probe control reads -1 for water too: probe fault, not the pack)

